WEBVTT

00:13:28.608 --> 00:13:31.905
So the question I started my talk with,

00:13:31.905 --> 00:13:35.105
who do you think is more difficult to face,

00:13:35.105 --> 00:13:38.062
oppressive governments or oppressive societies?

00:13:38.062 --> 00:13:40.961
I hope you find clues to answer that from my speech.

00:13:40.961 --> 00:13:42.417
Thank you, everyone.

00:13:42.417 --> 00:13:47.185
(Applause)

00:13:47.185 --> 00:13:50.309
Thank you.

00:13:50.309 --> 00:13:55.993
(Applause)

00:13:55.993 --> 00:13:59.517
Thank you. (Applause)